Date: Sun, 22 Feb 2026 12:04:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add update checker UI and version display in JS

- Add static/update_checker.js for banner and dismiss logic
- Add manualUpdateCheck() to settings.js using version fields
- Show current app version in footer via index.js
---
